# Sakrylle fork specifics

## Brand

Replace user-facing "Codex"/"codex"/"OpenAI Codex" with "Sakrylle"/"sakrylle" in CLI help, errors, update prompts, and `bin_name`.

## OIDC

RP integration in `codex-rs/login/src/oidc.rs`: JWKS verification, issuer/audience/nonce/exp validation, discovery doc validation. Local notes in `oidc-docs/`; canonical platform docs at `../../sub2api/sakrylle-docs/`.

## Config isolation

`codex-rs/config/` — profile-based isolation (`CODEX_HOME/<name>.config.toml`).

## Provider features

- `Sakrylle` provider enabled
- `codex_apps` MCP client disabled
- `image_generation` tools disabled for Sakrylle provider
